{"id":"rechtzeitig","lemma":"rechtzeitig","pos":"adv","rank":1700,"glosses":["in time","on time"],"ipa":"/ˈʁɛçtˌt͡saɪ̯tɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/De-rechtzeitig.ogg/De-rechtzeitig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Können Sie es rechtzeitig machen?","en":"Can you make it on time?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Er ist nicht rechtzeitig gekommen.","en":"He didn't come on time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755453","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Ich kam rechtzeitig zur Schule.","en":"I arrived at school on time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717863","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Er kam rechtzeitig an.","en":"He arrived in time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393511","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Schaffst du es noch rechtzeitig?","en":"Can you still make it on time?","words":[{"g":"to get done","l":"schaffen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"still / yet"},null]}]}